fically points out the personnel issue in agriculture, which is a significant point. Option D is more general about the professional market's development.\n\nI think the main emphasis is on the personnel issue because the passage gives examples about agricultural operators not knowing about drones and the difficulty in getting the right people. Therefore, the option is "]] 12%|#1        | 70/600 [01:31<07:28,  1.18it/s]
