which matches the context. The artist repaying the subsidy would make it easier for others to get support, so others can obtain benefits.\n\nOption B talks about a tacit promise, but the passage doesn't mention any promises, just the argument about others needing support.\n\nOption C mentions benefiting from others' actions, but the passage is about the artist's obligation, not about them benefiting from others.\n\nOption D talks about general benefits exceeding the cost, but the context specifically mentions providing support for others, not just any benefits. Therefore, the option is "]]
