t it\'s not about movement in a specific direction due to an external stimulus. It\'s more about the plant\'s ability to thrive in a particular condition rather than moving in a certain direction. So D doesn\'t fit the definition. Therefore, the option is ']] 29%|##9       | 175/600 [02:51<05:09,  1.37it/s]
