wo groups with the only difference being the support meetings.\n\nAlternatively, Option A is more concrete because it shows a direct positive effect of the support meetings, which would directly contradict the study's conclusion.\n\nWait, but the study's conclusion is that support meetings don't help. If the group with support meetings lived longer on average, that would actually support the idea that support meetings do help, thus weakening the argument that they don't help. Therefore, the option is "]]
