dle isn\'t the only peak, but it doesn\'t necessarily invalidate the conclusion as strongly as D. The conclusion is about the timing, not about individual variation. Therefore, the option is ']] 79%|#######8  | 473/600 [09:02<01:46,  1.19it/s]
