otivated (numb to work), has no desire to change (status quo), and hasn't been promoted. This is a clear example of self depletion because his motivation and ability to engage in his work have declined over time, leading to no progress in his career.\n\nSo, comparing the options, both B and D seem relevant. However, the context specifically mentions that self depletion involves a decline in ability or willingness to conduct voluntary activities, control the environment, make choices, etc. Option D describes a complete lack of desire to change, which is a significant decline in motivation, fitting the definition. Option B shows a lack of promotion but doesn't mention a complete decline in motivation or willingness to engage in activities beyond that. Therefore, the option is "]] 96%|#########5| 573/600 [11:56<00:17,  1.56it/s]
