e problems caused by the mechanisms and systems, which is option C.\n\nAlternatively, the context starts by talking about the reforms as a response to the rise of entrepreneurs, so the main emphasis is on creating the environment, which is option A. Therefore, the option is "]] 97%|#########7| 584/600 [12:05<00:17,  1.08s/it]
